B.IY=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Rolling Pin","",0,"Three sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are all over both handles: it is her rolling pin. Graham Cracker's are on the very tip of one handle. And Colonel Cannoli's are on the marble barrel itself, where the weight is.",B.ba,B.b7,null,B.i,B.c,!1,"churlock")
