B.IS=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Fruitcake","",0,"Only one dessert's prints came up on the fruitcake: Penny Cotta's. They are sharp and greasy. But then she baked it, twelve years ago, and it has sat in her pantry ever since. There are no others at all.",B.ba,B.b7,null,B.i,B.c,!1,"churlock")
B.qa=s(["penny"],t.s)
