B.IF=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Sugarloaf","",0,"Two sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are small and neat around the base, where a cook holds a loaf to nip it. The other is one large hand wrapped right round the narrow end, as you would grip a club. It is Barry Tart's.",B.ba,B.b7,null,B.i,B.c,!1,"churlock")
