B.JQ=new A.N("ironrack","Iron Trivet","kitchen",4,"The trivet beside the stove where the flat irons are kept warm. Three places, graded by size. The small iron and the middle iron are here. The place of the big one, the fourteen-pound goose iron, is an empty ring of rust.",B.L4,B.eQ,null,B.i,B.c,!1,null)
