B.JX=new A.N("cushion","The Colonel's Armchair","parlor",4,"The wing of the Colonel's armchair has a patch of ricotta on it the size of a saucer, at the height of a sleeping head, and his spare monocle has slipped down between the cushions.",B.KL,B.b6,null,B.i,B.c,!1,null)
